   "updated_at": "2026-11-15T12:22:49Z",
   "body": "**Watch item for this review (operator, 2026-11-15):** #908, the reader does not refresh after a confirmed edit in an MP, though `MessageWriteModel.editorDidClose` asks for a reload. If the cause turns out to be a separate MP path, that is exactly the kind of divergence this review targets: topic and MP readers, or write flows, doing the same job through different code. The fix merges them onto the best version and reuses it. Check the other topic/MP pairs (reply, quote, delete, flags, reload) for the same split.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
