   "updated_at": "2026-11-17T21:57:32Z",
   "body": "**Input for this review (operator, 2026-11-17).** The MPStorage thread showed in the MP list **in landscape but not in portrait** on the same build, and dev-swift has no filter for it. This suggests the **MP list is produced by more than one code path** (portrait list vs split sidebar, or segment and display variants).\n\n#1075 maps every MP-list path (`file:line`) and moves the hide rule to one shared source. Treat that map as a **candidate duplicate family**: the « MP list rows and counts » family, alongside group L (#817, #825, #842). If #1075 merges before this review runs, check that every path it listed now goes through the shared source.\n\nFor completeness, the operator's remit for the end-of-M4 code reviews:\n- **reuse and duplicates:** this issue;\n- **consistency, cleaning, dead-code removal, maintainability:** #775, which already lists consistency, dead code, duplication and speculative abstractions in its scope.\n\nFindings from #775 that are duplicates feed this issue.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
